An attribute line under an attributed sub-item stays in that item

```
- a
  -{#p} b
    {#x}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li id="p">b</li>
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - b
    {#x}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  1.{#p} b
     {#x}
  2. c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ol>
      <li id="p">b</li>
      <li>c</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
```
